{
  "title": "netdiag – MTR per hopp",
  "uid": "netdiag-mtr",
  "tags": [
    "netdiag"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "target",
        "label": "Mål",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(mtr_hops, name)",
          "refId": "v"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(mtr_hops, name)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "regex": "/^(.*)-mtr$/"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Tolkning:** Förlust på ett hopp i mitten som *inte* syns på senare hopp beror nästan alltid på att routern begränsar ICMP-svar och är inget fel. Förlust som börjar på ett hopp och finns kvar **ända till slutmålet** visar var problemet ligger. Tabellen gäller vald tidsperiod; zooma in på en incident för att se den isolerat."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Mål: $target",
      "repeat": "target",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Hopp för hopp – $target (vald period)",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(((max by (ttl, path) (avg_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"loss\"}[$__range]))) * on(path) group_left(hostname) max by (path, hostname) (netdiag_hop_info)) or on(ttl, path) (max by (ttl, path) (avg_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"loss\"}[$__range])))) * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(((max by (ttl, path) (max_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"loss\"}[$__range]))) * on(path) group_left(hostname) max by (path, hostname) (netdiag_hop_info)) or on(ttl, path) (max by (ttl, path) (max_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"loss\"}[$__range])))) * 100",
          "refId": "D",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(((max by (ttl, path) (avg_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"mean\"}[$__range]))) * on(path) group_left(hostname) max by (path, hostname) (netdiag_hop_info)) or on(ttl, path) (max by (ttl, path) (avg_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"mean\"}[$__range])))) * 1000",
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(((max by (ttl, path) (max_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"worst\"}[$__range]))) * on(path) group_left(hostname) max by (path, hostname) (netdiag_hop_info)) or on(ttl, path) (max by (ttl, path) (max_over_time(mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"worst\"}[$__range])))) * 1000",
          "refId": "C",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "name": true,
              "target": true,
              "type": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "ttl": 0,
              "path": 1,
              "hostname": 2,
              "Value #A": 3,
              "Value #D": 4,
              "Value #B": 5,
              "Value #C": 6
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "ttl": "Hopp",
              "path": "Adress",
              "Value #A": "Förlust %",
              "Value #D": "Max förlust %",
              "Value #B": "Snitt ms",
              "Value #C": "Värsta ms",
              "hostname": "Namn"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "convertFieldType",
          "options": {
            "conversions": [
              {
                "targetField": "Hopp",
                "destinationType": "number"
              }
            ],
            "fields": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Hopp"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Förlust %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 5
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Max förlust %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 5
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Snitt ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Värsta ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Hopp"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Slutmål $target – latens och förlust (ping)",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "expr": "ping_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-icmp\",type=\"mean\"} * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "Snitt ms ({{target_ip}})"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "time_series",
          "expr": "ping_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-icmp\",type=\"worst\"} * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "Värsta ms ({{target_ip}})"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "format": "time_series",
          "expr": "ping_loss_percent{name=~\"$target-icmp\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Förlust % ({{target_ip}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^Förlust.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "min",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.drawStyle",
                "value": "bars"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^Värsta.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    4,
                    4
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latens per hopp – $target",
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(((mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"mean\"}) * on(path) group_left(hostname) max by (path, hostname) (netdiag_hop_info)) or on(name, ttl, path, type) (mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"mean\"})) * 1000",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{ttl}}: {{path}} {{hostname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Name"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Förlust per hopp – $target",
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(((mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"loss\"}) * on(path) group_left(hostname) max by (path, hostname) (netdiag_hop_info)) or on(name, ttl, path, type) (mtr_rtt_seconds{name=~\"$target-mtr\",type=\"loss\"})) * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{ttl}}: {{path}} {{hostname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "sortBy": "Name"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Antal hopp – $target (ändras när vägen byts)",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "mtr_hops{name=~\"$target-mtr\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Hopp"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Felanmälningspaket för vald period (zip)",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "cloud",
      "url": "http://@NETMON_HOST@:8080/report?from=${__from}&to=${__to}",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "tooltip": "Skapar och laddar ner sammanfattning, avbrottslogg, MTR-rapporter och pinglogg för perioden du tittar på"
    },
    {
      "title": "Avbrottslogg och tidigare paket",
      "type": "link",
